        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Acorn MIABP / MIBBP, Knight Tip Rough Iron Dummy Strap Hinges For Interior And Exterior Doors</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Knight Tip Rough Iron Dummy Strap Hinges give an old world charm to any home without having to install working hinges. This makes them especially good to use where using a working hinge would be impractical, like on a garage door. Acorn's dummy strap hinges are for use with butt hinges. They are surface mounted (screwed to the door) with the included matching finish screws. The rough iron finish has a lifetime no rust warranty; and the finish duplicates that found on the ironwork of many old European castles and cathedrals by imitating the texture of naturally weathered iron.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWhen combined with our other great <a href=\"/collections/acorn\">Hand Forged Iron Products</a>, Acorn can really make your home stand out.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Rough Iron Knight Tip Dummy Strap Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Rough Black Iron</b></li>\r\n<li>Packaged with black finish mounting wood screws.</li>\r\n<li>For exterior and interior use.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime No-Rust Warranty!</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>MIABP</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 17-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>MIBBP</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 20-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/acorn-hinges.jpg?v=1704354542\" border=\"0\"\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
